// Does a map load? Waits for the player, takes one screenshot three seconds after entry
// and quits. Run it with the retail-capture skill on any map, the example maps included:
//   .claude\skills\retail-capture\scripts\capture.ps1 -Probe probe-load -Map example/rain
// A map that fails to load never reaches waitforplayer, so its run takes no screenshot.
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 3
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 0.5
stuffcmd "quit"
end
